WEBVTT

00:43.000 --> 00:43.880
You are on duty today.

00:45.240 --> 00:46.430
I'll have dinner ready

00:46.672 --> 00:47.890
and wait for you to come home.

00:48.240 --> 00:49.240
That's thoughtful.

00:49.260 --> 00:51.070
But I made plans
with Ding Zhi and the others

00:51.070 --> 00:52.600
to hear the new songs at Yunshao House.

00:52.750 --> 00:53.520
But we...

00:53.790 --> 00:54.430
What about us?

00:58.280 --> 00:59.320
Things between us

00:59.840 --> 01:00.600
have changed.

01:02.200 --> 01:03.200
How have they changed?

01:08.144 --> 01:09.560
About what happened last night,

01:10.208 --> 01:11.632
I'll take responsibility.

01:15.680 --> 01:17.840
What happened between us
was by mutual consent.

01:17.840 --> 01:19.056
We both got what we wanted.

01:19.104 --> 01:20.200
If you take it seriously,

01:20.200 --> 01:21.552
you're the one who's mistaken.

01:24.560 --> 01:26.280
But we've already consummated...

01:26.656 --> 01:28.510
I will take responsibility
to the very end.

01:29.664 --> 01:31.008
For the rest of my life,

01:31.632 --> 01:32.710
there will only be you.

01:39.488 --> 01:41.950
I've spent my life wandering
through pleasure houses.

01:41.950 --> 01:42.950
Never once have I cared

01:42.950 --> 01:44.280
about preserving my chastity.

01:44.760 --> 01:46.430
Nor would I ever spend my life

01:46.430 --> 01:48.672
tied to one man over something
as trivial as virtue.

01:49.040 --> 01:51.000
It was just a brief encounter.

01:51.664 --> 01:52.976
Let's leave it at that.

03:46.096 --> 03:46.890
=Blossoms of Power=

03:46.896 --> 03:49.780
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:49.860 --> 03:52.820
=Episode 25=

03:53.408 --> 03:55.232
I have learned that
Cui Jinbai and Bu Shulin

03:55.264 --> 03:57.400
spent the entire night drinking
at Yunshao House yesterday.

03:57.424 --> 03:58.580
They stayed in the same room.

03:58.590 --> 04:00.400
They didn't leave together
until this morning.

04:01.030 --> 04:02.750
Keep watching their movements.

04:03.424 --> 04:05.248
Find out the nature
of their relationship.

04:05.400 --> 04:06.560
If anything unusual comes up,

04:06.750 --> 04:08.080
report to me immediately.

04:08.560 --> 04:09.000
Yes.

04:41.800 --> 04:42.950
My Lord.

04:43.360 --> 04:44.830
You're investigating

04:45.160 --> 04:46.870
Young Master Bu and Vice Minister Cui?

04:47.800 --> 04:49.360
Rumors about

04:49.456 --> 04:51.560
those two have
been circulating for some time.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.510
But Cui Jinbai

04:53.510 --> 04:55.630
is well known
for his impeccable conduct.

04:56.430 --> 04:58.672
How could he become so close

04:58.800 --> 05:00.500
to a notorious playboy like Bu Shulin,

05:00.510 --> 05:02.310
and even move into his residence?

05:03.510 --> 05:05.390
I simply can't believe

05:06.630 --> 05:08.070
Vice Minister Cui

05:09.070 --> 05:10.800
would develop feelings

05:11.750 --> 05:13.040
for another man.

05:15.040 --> 05:16.720
That's hardly the only suspicious thing.

05:17.840 --> 05:20.480
The Crown Princess is known
for being aloof and reserved,

05:21.920 --> 05:23.680
yet she became close friends

05:23.680 --> 05:24.870
with that libertine Bu Shulin.

05:26.160 --> 05:28.310
Even the Crown Prince
allows the Crown Princess

05:28.400 --> 05:30.112
to associate so closely
with another man.

05:30.160 --> 05:32.270
Ever since Father intended for Bu Shulin

05:32.270 --> 05:34.240
to marry Princess Anling,

05:34.240 --> 05:36.160
he latched onto Cui Jinbai

05:36.240 --> 05:38.560
and single-handedly ruined the match.

05:39.360 --> 05:42.240
Bu Shulin is the only young master
of the Marquis of Shunan.

05:42.240 --> 05:43.680
Yet he's in no hurry to marry,

05:43.800 --> 05:45.830
and the Marquis
seems completely unconcerned.

05:46.800 --> 05:48.070
That makes no sense.

05:49.800 --> 05:50.920
My Lord,

05:52.600 --> 05:54.160
have you already formed a theory?

05:57.800 --> 05:59.000
What if

05:59.270 --> 06:00.950
Bu Shulin

06:02.000 --> 06:04.040
isn't actually a man?

06:06.240 --> 06:08.070
If Bu Shulin were a lady,

06:09.480 --> 06:11.310
then everything that seems so strange

06:11.830 --> 06:13.040
would make perfect sense.

06:26.240 --> 06:27.190
My Lady,

06:28.190 --> 06:29.480
you truly are perceptive.

06:29.920 --> 06:31.360
If that's really the case,

06:32.920 --> 06:35.430
once Bu Shulin's identity
as a lady is exposed,

06:36.624 --> 06:39.856
the Marquis of Shunan will surely be
charged with deceiving the Emperor.

06:40.190 --> 06:42.160
If you expose the Marquis of Shunan,

06:42.272 --> 06:45.184
you'll have the best chance
of taking command of the Shunan army.

06:48.870 --> 06:50.430
You think so highly of me.

06:50.950 --> 06:54.040
I am truly gratified.

06:55.600 --> 06:57.510
As your wife,

06:58.390 --> 07:00.270
it's only natural for me
to ease your burdens.

07:01.680 --> 07:05.120
I am willing to do anything
for Your Highness.

07:13.190 --> 07:13.920
My Lady,

07:15.310 --> 07:17.040
have you already come up with a plan?

07:18.600 --> 07:20.160
The best way

07:21.390 --> 07:23.160
is to have His Majesty

07:24.480 --> 07:26.120
arrange a marriage for Young Master Bu.

07:50.270 --> 07:53.190
What you said to Second Prince just now,

07:53.430 --> 07:55.240
could it be seen
as overstepping your place?

08:03.190 --> 08:05.800
I know I'm not blessed
with breathtaking beauty,

08:06.360 --> 08:08.600
nor do I come from a powerful family.

08:09.120 --> 08:11.800
Second Prince's heart
belongs to Shen Yingruo.

08:13.560 --> 08:14.920
I've never hoped

08:14.920 --> 08:17.830
to share some fleeting romance with him.

08:19.160 --> 08:20.680
Only in this way

08:22.390 --> 08:24.390
might I become

08:24.750 --> 08:26.190
someone he cannot do without.

08:31.120 --> 08:33.270
Greetings to Father and Grandmother.

08:33.840 --> 08:34.600
Rise.

08:35.790 --> 08:37.550
Father, Grandmother.

08:37.960 --> 08:39.910
I'm here with good news.

08:40.840 --> 08:42.440
Qingshu is expecting.

08:42.840 --> 08:43.790
- Good.
- Great.

08:44.440 --> 08:46.270
That is wonderful news indeed.

08:46.480 --> 08:50.320
If she gives birth
to the royal family's eldest grandson,

08:50.670 --> 08:52.910
that would truly be a blessing.

08:55.000 --> 08:56.000
Changmin,

08:56.720 --> 08:58.200
only after becoming a father

08:58.200 --> 09:00.960
will you understand
how difficult it is to raise a child.

09:02.000 --> 09:04.630
You should also start thinking about
your own future.

09:04.704 --> 09:06.432
Thank you for your guidance, Father.

09:06.910 --> 09:08.320
I have one more matter

09:08.630 --> 09:10.120
I'd like to discuss with you.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.840
Speak freely.

09:13.360 --> 09:14.910
I'd like to ask Father

09:14.910 --> 09:16.768
to arrange a marriage
for Young Master Bu.

09:21.000 --> 09:24.080
Has Young Master Bu
asked you to do this?

09:24.790 --> 09:25.670
Not at all.

09:26.750 --> 09:27.480
Recently,

09:27.550 --> 09:29.150
while reviewing cases at the Censorate,

09:29.550 --> 09:32.270
I found that nearly half the pending
cases involve Young Master Bu.

09:32.464 --> 09:34.720
Some were for trampling crops
while riding recklessly.

09:34.768 --> 09:36.790
Others for drinking
and violating the curfew.

09:36.816 --> 09:39.680
He even got into street fights
with the sons of noble families.

09:40.240 --> 09:41.270
I was thinking,

09:41.600 --> 09:42.360
why not

09:42.750 --> 09:44.910
find him a young lady
from a distinguished family?

09:45.480 --> 09:47.320
She could guide him with proper conduct

09:47.376 --> 09:49.136
and bring order to his household.

09:51.200 --> 09:53.390
The Crown Prince has arrived.

09:59.240 --> 10:01.840
Greetings to Father and Grandmother.

10:02.630 --> 10:03.960
Huayong, you're here.

10:03.960 --> 10:04.670
Rise.

10:05.910 --> 10:06.870
Huayong,

10:07.030 --> 10:07.960
your second brother

10:08.360 --> 10:10.840
has been worrying
about Bu Shulin's marriage.

10:16.208 --> 10:18.200
Changmin has always
been strict with himself,

10:18.256 --> 10:20.176
yet remarkably
considerate toward others.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.870
I agree with Second Brother.

10:23.150 --> 10:25.360
It wasn't until after I married
that I realized

10:25.550 --> 10:26.870
a man only truly matures

10:26.960 --> 10:28.120
once he has a family.

10:29.550 --> 10:30.550
Well said.

10:31.390 --> 10:34.870
The Marquis of Shunan has only one heir,
Young Master Bu.

10:35.120 --> 10:37.080
I've also been thinking

10:37.390 --> 10:39.600
it's time he married,

10:39.870 --> 10:42.150
so the Marquis' family line
may continue.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.200
How about this?

10:45.440 --> 10:47.960
Mother, I'll trouble you
with this matter.

10:48.270 --> 10:51.840
Choose a young lady from
a distinguished family to be his wife.

10:51.960 --> 10:52.848
What do you think?

10:53.480 --> 10:54.670
Rest assured.

10:55.080 --> 10:58.120
It's time we found him a virtuous wife

10:58.120 --> 11:00.120
to keep him in line.

11:02.096 --> 11:05.104
- Thank you, Father, Grandmother.
- Thank you, Father, Grandmother.

11:13.750 --> 11:15.960
Changmin already suspects
that Bu Shulin is a lady.

11:16.144 --> 11:18.320
He plans to expose it
through an arranged marriage.

11:20.360 --> 11:21.870
We must act before they do

11:22.240 --> 11:23.910
and find Lin a marriage.

11:24.510 --> 11:27.200
But finding a bride
who can conceal Lin's identity

11:27.510 --> 11:29.200
and never betray her

11:29.910 --> 11:31.000
is no easy task.

11:34.120 --> 11:34.670
Your Highness.

11:34.680 --> 11:36.790
An invitation has arrived
from Prince Ning's Mansion.

11:36.816 --> 11:39.072
It's for Fourteenth Prince's
seventh birthday banquet.

11:39.270 --> 11:41.510
Prince Ning has invited
Lady Song of Bright Deportment

11:41.630 --> 11:43.270
to host a banquet at his residence.

11:43.344 --> 11:45.328
Young Master Bu
is also among the guests.

11:48.060 --> 11:50.500
(Prince Ning's Mansion)

11:51.536 --> 11:54.304
- Greetings, Your Highnesses.
- Greetings, Your Highnesses.

12:10.360 --> 12:12.440
Let's go see the birds later.

12:12.960 --> 12:14.390
Be sure to come soon.

12:14.870 --> 12:15.320
All right.

12:15.550 --> 12:16.120
Let's go.

12:21.790 --> 12:22.510
Mother.

12:22.630 --> 12:24.540
(Xiao Changhong, Fourteenth Prince)
I want to feed the birds.

12:24.550 --> 12:25.720
(Xiao Changhong, Fourteenth Prince)
Changmin's residence

12:25.840 --> 12:27.510
(Xiao Changhong, Fourteenth Prince)
has many rare birds.

12:27.780 --> 12:29.420
(Lady Song of Bright Deportment)
All right.

12:29.456 --> 12:30.590
(Lady Song of Bright Deportment)
But you mustn't run around,

12:30.600 --> 12:31.630
(Lady Song of Bright Deportment)
or you might get hurt.

12:37.184 --> 12:38.910
Take Fourteenth Prince to see the birds.

12:38.910 --> 12:39.910
Watch over him carefully.

12:40.960 --> 12:41.480
Yes.

12:44.790 --> 12:46.790
Prince Ning. Princess Consort Ning.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.550
Thank you for holding
Changhong's birthday banquet.

12:49.910 --> 12:51.270
It's been arranged so grandly.

12:51.480 --> 12:52.390
I truly appreciate it.

12:52.630 --> 12:53.910
You're too kind, Lady Song.

12:54.440 --> 12:56.550
Changhong is the youngest of the princes

12:56.630 --> 12:57.840
and exceptionally bright.

12:58.390 --> 12:59.870
Not only is he dearly loved by Father,

13:00.750 --> 13:03.120
but all of us brothers
are fond of him as well.

13:03.910 --> 13:06.750
His birthday banquet
has always been held in the palace.

13:06.870 --> 13:09.024
This year, I thought
we'd do something different.

13:09.150 --> 13:10.510
If there's anything lacking,

13:10.608 --> 13:11.790
I hope you'll forgive us.

13:12.550 --> 13:13.670
Not at all.

13:14.510 --> 13:16.200
Changhong is delighted.

13:16.960 --> 13:17.840
This way, everyone.

13:36.200 --> 13:38.000
Your Highness, slow down.

13:38.560 --> 13:39.630
Slow down, Your Highness.

13:40.304 --> 13:41.744
- Changhong!
- Be careful!

13:42.270 --> 13:43.870
Changhong, you're here.

13:46.600 --> 13:48.790
Look! The birds are so beautiful.

13:49.600 --> 13:51.510
Look! It's eating.

13:56.480 --> 13:58.390
Miss, shall we go over there?

13:58.390 --> 13:59.000
Sure.

14:00.000 --> 14:00.600
Slow down.

14:01.960 --> 14:02.510
Be careful.

14:02.720 --> 14:04.000
Help!

14:04.000 --> 14:05.120
Fourteenth Prince
has fallen into the water!

14:05.120 --> 14:06.200
Help!

14:06.200 --> 14:06.910
Changhong!

14:07.000 --> 14:08.150
- Changhong!
- Help!

14:08.160 --> 14:09.510
Fourteenth Prince
has fallen into the water!

14:09.510 --> 14:10.360
Help!

14:15.520 --> 14:16.960
Your Highness, something has happened.

14:16.960 --> 14:18.990
Fourteenth Prince accidentally
fell into the water.

14:21.390 --> 14:22.550
How is he now?

14:22.550 --> 14:24.624
He's fine. Young Master Bu
has already rescued him.

14:27.480 --> 14:28.320
Prince Ning.

14:28.840 --> 14:29.840
What happened?

14:30.600 --> 14:32.840
Changhong accidentally
fell into the water.

14:33.200 --> 14:33.870
What?

14:34.750 --> 14:36.270
Don't panic, Lady Song.

14:36.270 --> 14:37.910
Fortunately, Young Master Bu was nearby.

14:37.910 --> 14:39.510
He has already rescued Changhong.

14:39.510 --> 14:41.260
The Imperial Physician
is examining him now.

14:41.270 --> 14:42.200
Take me there at once.

14:42.200 --> 14:42.790
Lead the way.

14:42.790 --> 14:43.200
Yes.

14:49.150 --> 14:49.960
Physician Zhou.

14:50.150 --> 14:51.240
Is Changhong all right?

14:51.790 --> 14:52.840
Your Highness,

14:53.080 --> 14:55.120
Fourteenth Prince only caught a chill.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.080
He's out of danger.

14:58.600 --> 15:00.080
Thank heavens.

15:00.320 --> 15:01.670
Changhong is fine.

15:02.016 --> 15:03.200
Where is Young Master Bu?

15:04.240 --> 15:05.440
It's all my fault.

15:05.520 --> 15:07.088
I was only thinking about Changhong.

15:07.790 --> 15:09.240
Where is Young Master Bu now?

15:09.250 --> 15:11.590
Young Master Bu is changing
in a side room at Wancui Garden.

15:12.360 --> 15:14.030
I hope he hasn't caught a chill either.

15:14.150 --> 15:14.870
Physician Zhou.

15:15.240 --> 15:16.390
Come with me to check on him.

15:16.630 --> 15:17.120
Yes.

15:21.390 --> 15:22.270
Young Master Bu.

15:22.600 --> 15:23.600
Are you in there?

15:27.840 --> 15:28.670
Young Master Bu.

15:28.960 --> 15:30.360
I've brought the Imperial Physician.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.270
Are you all right?

15:34.630 --> 15:36.120
Could something have happened?

15:44.390 --> 15:44.750
Quick.

15:44.910 --> 15:45.630
Get up.

15:48.910 --> 15:49.630
This...

15:57.328 --> 15:58.640
Young Master Bu, you...

15:59.750 --> 16:00.910
Please don't misunderstand.

16:01.270 --> 16:02.670
I was changing just now.

16:02.800 --> 16:05.440
She insisted on barging in
and throwing herself into my arms.

16:05.440 --> 16:06.840
Isn't that Fifth Young Lady Yu,

16:07.150 --> 16:09.510
Second Prince's wife's younger cousin?

16:09.630 --> 16:11.790
Brother-in-law, I...

16:25.720 --> 16:26.790
Bu Shulin!

16:27.670 --> 16:28.440
Outrageous!

16:29.200 --> 16:30.600
This is absolutely outrageous!

16:31.270 --> 16:31.870
Your Majesty,

16:32.240 --> 16:33.600
I was framed.

16:33.960 --> 16:35.510
After I rescued Fourteenth Prince,

16:35.510 --> 16:37.520
I was taken to Wancui Garden
to change my clothes.

16:37.536 --> 16:38.480
But for some reason,

16:38.790 --> 16:41.240
I suddenly felt feverish
and my mind became clouded.

16:41.240 --> 16:43.030
Then Fifth Young Lady Yu burst in

16:43.030 --> 16:44.360
and insisted on sleeping with me.

16:44.688 --> 16:46.270
I fought with all my strength to resist,

16:46.510 --> 16:47.440
but unfortunately,

16:47.440 --> 16:48.750
my body would not obey me.

16:48.750 --> 16:49.870
She almost had her way.

16:50.120 --> 16:51.600
Fortunately, everyone arrived in time.

16:52.030 --> 16:52.750
Otherwise,

16:53.360 --> 16:55.200
I could never have cleared my name.

16:55.200 --> 16:55.910
Nonsense!

16:56.144 --> 16:57.720
You're highly skilled in martial arts.

16:57.960 --> 16:59.550
How could a mere weak lady

16:59.550 --> 17:01.550
strip off your clothes?

17:02.030 --> 17:02.750
Father,

17:03.200 --> 17:04.720
Young Master Bu is telling the truth.

17:05.240 --> 17:06.720
When Prince Ning forced the door open,

17:07.070 --> 17:09.240
I smelled
a strange fragrance in the room.

17:09.504 --> 17:11.480
It was the scent
of Three-Leaf Nine-Blade Herb.

17:12.550 --> 17:14.350
What does that
have to do with this matter?

17:14.550 --> 17:16.400
The scent of Three-Leaf Nine-Blade Herb

17:16.510 --> 17:18.110
can cloud one's mind and arouse desire.

17:18.440 --> 17:19.480
Come to think of it,

17:19.960 --> 17:20.880
Fifth Young Lady Yu

17:21.350 --> 17:22.680
is Changmin's sister-in-law.

17:27.590 --> 17:28.790
Your Highness,

17:29.510 --> 17:30.790
what exactly

17:31.110 --> 17:32.270
do you mean by that?

17:37.480 --> 17:38.590
If Fifth Young Lady Yu

17:38.590 --> 17:41.030
had consummated
the marriage with Bu Shulin,

17:41.510 --> 17:43.160
then you and Bu Shulin

17:43.240 --> 17:44.440
would have become family.

17:49.030 --> 17:50.030
Changmin,

17:51.550 --> 17:53.000
how do you explain this?

17:59.310 --> 17:59.960
Father,

18:00.510 --> 18:02.350
I never intended to use this

18:02.350 --> 18:04.304
to win over the Marquis
of Shunan's household.

18:05.680 --> 18:07.590
Please allow me some time.

18:07.590 --> 18:09.070
I will uncover the truth

18:09.070 --> 18:10.848
and give Young Master Bu an explanation.

18:11.720 --> 18:12.480
Very well.

18:13.270 --> 18:13.790
I

18:15.400 --> 18:17.720
allow you to prove your innocence.

18:18.200 --> 18:21.310
Work with the Chief Minister
and the Chief Justice

18:21.440 --> 18:22.880
to investigate this matter together.

18:23.070 --> 18:24.030
Thank you, Father.

18:27.100 --> 18:30.140
(Contemplating the Pine Breeze)

18:31.376 --> 18:32.590
Greetings, Young Master Bu.

19:15.110 --> 19:15.790
Remarkable.

19:16.000 --> 19:17.550
It's truly remarkable.

19:18.030 --> 19:18.960
Xihe,

19:18.960 --> 19:20.960
where did you find such a treasure?

19:22.270 --> 19:23.310
His name is Shen Shijiu.

19:23.328 --> 19:24.790
He serves in the Northwestern Army.

19:25.400 --> 19:26.790
When my brother came to the capital,

19:26.920 --> 19:28.550
I saw that his build and appearance

19:28.550 --> 19:29.880
were eighty percent like yours,

19:30.240 --> 19:31.590
so I kept him in the capital.

19:33.680 --> 19:35.400
But he looks exactly like me.

19:35.400 --> 19:36.992
I thought I was looking into a mirror.

19:37.240 --> 19:39.830
I asked Physician Xie
to use his bone-sculpting technique

19:39.904 --> 19:42.272
to alter his face,
from eighty percent resemblance

19:42.304 --> 19:43.160
to a perfect match.

19:43.510 --> 19:45.790
The Crown Prince
also used Tagara Incense

19:46.070 --> 19:47.830
to make his voice sound like yours.

19:48.720 --> 19:51.160
From now on,
Shen Shijiu will stay by your side

19:51.510 --> 19:53.790
to learn your way of speaking,

19:54.200 --> 19:55.790
your handwriting, and your mannerisms.

19:56.200 --> 19:58.200
If anyone ever tries to expose you,

19:58.400 --> 19:59.680
he'll prove useful.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.590
Thank you, Xihe,

20:01.720 --> 20:03.110
for thinking of everything.

20:06.440 --> 20:07.270
Shen Shijiu,

20:08.680 --> 20:10.070
you must study well.

20:10.680 --> 20:12.200
You must not make a single mistake.

20:12.480 --> 20:13.480
One careless slip,

20:13.640 --> 20:14.880
and it will mean utter ruin.

20:17.000 --> 20:17.440
Yes.

20:18.680 --> 20:19.480
You may leave.

20:28.110 --> 20:28.790
Lin,

20:29.640 --> 20:31.070
have you made up your mind

20:31.240 --> 20:32.310
about you and Cui Jinbai?

20:36.640 --> 20:37.400
Careful with it.

20:37.400 --> 20:42.300
(Marquis of Shunan's Manor)

20:57.040 --> 20:58.920
I've imposed on you these past few days.

20:59.750 --> 21:00.790
Today, I'll take my leave.

21:04.240 --> 21:05.440
You're too polite.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.680
You'll always be welcome here.

21:07.830 --> 21:08.720
Vice Minister Cui,

21:08.752 --> 21:10.070
you're welcome back anytime.

21:10.590 --> 21:12.350
For a drink or a song.

21:18.750 --> 21:19.880
Thank you for taking me in.

22:15.620 --> 22:20.380
(Marquis of Shunan's Manor)

22:28.620 --> 22:31.900
(Court of Judicial Review)

22:34.160 --> 22:35.960
Please see the truth, Vice Minister Cui.

22:36.270 --> 22:38.830
I have never admired Young Master Bu,

22:39.350 --> 22:42.030
nor did I ever use
an aphrodisiac against him.

22:42.480 --> 22:45.510
That day, I was drugged as well

22:46.030 --> 22:47.270
and lost consciousness.

22:47.510 --> 22:49.440
When I awoke,
I was already in that room.

22:49.830 --> 22:51.880
Please uncover the truth,
Vice Minister Cui,

22:51.880 --> 22:53.590
and clear my name.

22:54.790 --> 22:55.590
Fifth Sister,

22:56.480 --> 22:58.310
your elder sister is my wife.

22:59.200 --> 23:01.510
I've always treated you
as my own sister.

23:02.160 --> 23:03.400
But in this matter,

23:04.160 --> 23:05.480
the evidence is conclusive.

23:05.920 --> 23:07.550
Only by confessing truthfully

23:08.200 --> 23:09.480
can Vice Minister Cui

23:09.920 --> 23:11.270
show leniency.

23:11.590 --> 23:12.680
Fifth Young Lady Yu,

23:13.424 --> 23:14.790
after learning that my residence

23:14.790 --> 23:16.960
would be hosting Fourteenth Prince's
birthday banquet,

23:17.640 --> 23:20.310
you begged me repeatedly
to let you enter the manor,

23:20.720 --> 23:22.920
just to catch a glimpse
of Young Master Bu from afar.

23:23.270 --> 23:24.270
It's my fault as well.

23:25.160 --> 23:26.270
I softened for a moment

23:26.320 --> 23:27.480
and agreed to your request.

23:27.830 --> 23:28.960
Nonsense!

23:29.160 --> 23:32.110
When did I ever tell you
I admired Young Master Bu?

23:32.680 --> 23:35.200
You were the one who invited me
to the birthday banquet.

23:35.264 --> 23:37.200
I only accepted
out of respect for Second Prince.

23:37.200 --> 23:38.960
I couldn't very well refuse.

23:53.680 --> 23:54.590
Vice Minister Cui,

23:55.270 --> 23:57.000
every word I've said is the truth.

23:57.160 --> 23:58.640
I haven't uttered a single lie.

23:59.550 --> 24:02.680
Please see the truth, Vice Minister Cui.

24:03.000 --> 24:04.550
Did you find any other clues

24:04.550 --> 24:05.720
in Fifth Lady Yu's room?

24:06.992 --> 24:08.416
Reporting to you, My Lord,

24:08.480 --> 24:10.928
we found a box of incense made
from Three-Leaf Nine-Blade Herb

24:11.070 --> 24:13.830
hidden in a secret compartment
in Fifth Young Lady Yu's bedroom.

24:14.310 --> 24:16.070
We also found
a portrait of Young Master Bu.

24:17.160 --> 24:18.310
The incense?

24:19.590 --> 24:20.480
The portrait?

24:22.440 --> 24:24.440
How could these be in my room?

24:28.000 --> 24:29.200
It was you!

24:30.270 --> 24:31.960
You framed me!

24:31.960 --> 24:32.400
You...

24:33.830 --> 24:35.510
Have you lost your mind?

24:35.880 --> 24:37.240
You've gone completely mad.

24:37.240 --> 24:38.480
Don't touch me!

24:39.750 --> 24:41.240
Now that it's come to this,

24:42.680 --> 24:45.270
my parents have cast me aside
like a worthless rag.

24:45.376 --> 24:47.110
They no longer care
whether I live or die.

24:47.720 --> 24:49.920
What more is there for me to say?

24:55.160 --> 24:55.880
Stop her!

24:59.270 --> 25:00.440
Have you lost your mind?

25:02.750 --> 25:05.680
I know you've come fully prepared today

25:05.920 --> 25:07.200
to frame me.

25:07.590 --> 25:09.310
Then I'll use my own life

25:09.310 --> 25:10.680
to prove my innocence.

25:11.240 --> 25:12.510
The wicked

25:13.400 --> 25:14.960
will meet a bad end.

25:56.310 --> 25:57.680
Princess Anling, please step aside.

25:59.240 --> 26:00.200
The path is so wide.

26:00.200 --> 26:01.790
Isn't there enough room for you to pass?

26:02.350 --> 26:03.070
How dare you!

26:03.830 --> 26:05.000
You dare block my way?

26:05.240 --> 26:06.790
Princess Consort Ning is pregnant.

26:06.790 --> 26:08.256
She isn't able to move about easily.

26:08.304 --> 26:09.872
Princess Anling, please step aside.

26:10.550 --> 26:11.880
She looks perfectly fine to me.

26:11.880 --> 26:13.130
What's inconvenient about her?

26:13.168 --> 26:13.632
Move aside.

26:15.240 --> 26:15.830
Princess!

26:16.200 --> 26:16.880
Princess!

26:18.880 --> 26:20.070
The Princess is bleeding!

26:20.510 --> 26:21.350
Gu Qingshu!

26:21.350 --> 26:23.088
How dare you let your maid injure me!

26:23.160 --> 26:24.200
What happened?

26:27.830 --> 26:28.550
Sister-in-law.

26:36.960 --> 26:38.240
You came at the perfect time.

26:38.320 --> 26:39.830
Princess Consort Ning has gone too far.

26:39.904 --> 26:41.408
I've never had any grievance with her.

26:41.410 --> 26:43.760
Yet the moment we met today,
she not only forced me to give way.

26:43.776 --> 26:45.376
She even let her maid shove me.

26:45.920 --> 26:47.070
Greetings, Crown Princess.

26:48.480 --> 26:49.720
You've misunderstood, Princess.

26:50.440 --> 26:52.590
There are bottomless lakes
on both sides.

26:52.768 --> 26:55.160
Ruyi feared the Princess
and I might bump into each other.

26:55.160 --> 26:56.700
She only wanted both sides to give way.

26:56.720 --> 26:58.320
So neither side would be inconvenienced.

26:58.330 --> 27:00.390
Who would've thought
the Princess would take offense,

27:00.400 --> 27:01.550
insist on pushing forward,

27:02.070 --> 27:03.240
and nearly run into me?

27:05.160 --> 27:06.440
Is what she says true?

27:09.480 --> 27:09.880
But...

27:10.350 --> 27:12.550
She clearly forced me to give way.

27:14.680 --> 27:16.200
Princess Anling was the one at fault.

27:16.304 --> 27:18.448
You should apologize
to Princess Consort Ning.

27:18.720 --> 27:19.240
I...

27:25.920 --> 27:27.270
I was too rash.

27:27.344 --> 27:29.104
Please forgive me, Second Sister-in-law.

27:29.240 --> 27:31.590
We're family. There's no need
to stand on ceremony.

27:31.720 --> 27:33.790
Please don't take it to heart, Princess.

27:33.880 --> 27:35.960
The Princess was indeed out of line.

27:36.720 --> 27:38.240
But Princess Consort Ning's maid

27:38.750 --> 27:39.920
showed no regard for rank.

27:40.680 --> 27:43.030
Those who serve
their masters should be loyal.

27:43.590 --> 27:45.960
But they mustn't see only
their own master.

27:47.830 --> 27:49.000
I was foolish.

27:49.000 --> 27:50.590
I never meant to offend the Princess.

27:50.590 --> 27:52.064
I beg Your Highness for forgiveness.

27:52.310 --> 27:53.000
Execute her.

27:53.000 --> 27:53.400
Yes.

27:56.680 --> 27:57.960
Spare me, Your Highness!

27:57.960 --> 27:59.400
Please spare me, Your Highness!

27:59.510 --> 28:00.880
Spare me, Your Highness!

28:01.070 --> 28:02.880
Princess Consort Ning, save me!

28:02.880 --> 28:03.510
Sister-in-law...

28:03.520 --> 28:04.700
Please spare me, Your Highness!

28:04.720 --> 28:06.768
It's getting late.
You should head back now.

28:08.240 --> 28:08.750
Yes.

28:09.110 --> 28:10.830
Mercy, Your Highness!

28:18.880 --> 28:19.590
Help!

28:21.000 --> 28:21.830
Save me!

28:22.960 --> 28:23.830
Princess Consort Ning.

28:41.030 --> 28:42.160
Thank you, Your Highness.

28:43.030 --> 28:43.790
Thank me?

28:46.550 --> 28:48.110
If not for Your Highness's reminder,

28:48.480 --> 28:49.480
I wouldn't have realized

28:49.480 --> 28:51.110
that keeping such a reckless servant

28:51.110 --> 28:52.000
by my side

28:52.270 --> 28:53.720
would bring endless trouble.

28:54.750 --> 28:56.200
Your Highness is far more farsighted

28:56.440 --> 28:57.720
than I could ever hope to be.

28:58.830 --> 29:00.240
A reckless servant?

29:02.070 --> 29:03.270
You're far too modest.

29:04.110 --> 29:05.400
Under your guidance,

29:06.110 --> 29:07.720
this servant became

29:08.160 --> 29:09.480
quite adept at harming others.

29:11.350 --> 29:13.920
I don't understand
what Your Highness is talking about.

29:14.270 --> 29:15.160
Still pretending?

29:16.480 --> 29:18.350
Shall I recount everything you've done,

29:18.680 --> 29:20.110
one by one?

29:21.750 --> 29:22.750
What have I done?

29:23.200 --> 29:24.510
I have no idea what you mean.

29:24.920 --> 29:25.550
Very well.

29:25.920 --> 29:27.110
Let me refresh your memory.

29:28.720 --> 29:30.350
To win the Empress Dowager's favor,

29:30.720 --> 29:32.310
you gained Hu Yingrao's trust.

29:32.750 --> 29:33.920
You used vervain

29:34.200 --> 29:35.640
to make her break out in a rash.

29:36.270 --> 29:37.790
Then you seized the chance to perform.

29:38.680 --> 29:39.960
You created

29:40.400 --> 29:42.240
a touching tale of two devoted sisters.

29:42.304 --> 29:44.820
Then you deliberately presented
the Empress Dowager with roses,

29:44.830 --> 29:46.270
keeping her awake at night.

29:46.440 --> 29:47.240
After that,

29:47.840 --> 29:49.880
you gave her a scented sachet
to help her sleep.

29:49.960 --> 29:52.110
What a perfectly staged performance.

29:53.310 --> 29:56.240
You ordered Young Master Wen
to assassinate Prince Ning.

29:56.960 --> 29:59.030
Hu Yingrao died saving Prince Ning.

29:59.680 --> 30:01.350
Even in death,
she paved the way for you,

30:01.840 --> 30:03.510
allowing you to climb step by step

30:03.510 --> 30:05.240
to the rank of imperial consort.

30:07.350 --> 30:09.350
You held Fourteenth Prince's
birthday banquet

30:09.790 --> 30:11.480
and set a trap for Young Master Bu.

30:12.030 --> 30:13.960
You drove Fifth Young Lady Yu

30:14.310 --> 30:15.590
to take her own life.

30:16.070 --> 30:17.550
Everyone connected to it

30:17.750 --> 30:19.160
was silenced by you.

30:19.350 --> 30:20.830
Yet you alone walked away unscathed.

30:21.790 --> 30:22.640
Gu Qingshu,

30:23.310 --> 30:24.550
everything you've done

30:24.790 --> 30:26.550
was made possible by this maid.

30:27.200 --> 30:28.350
Her death today

30:28.830 --> 30:30.310
is of her own making.

30:32.590 --> 30:34.750
I don't know
how I've offended Your Highness,

30:35.440 --> 30:37.880
for Your Highness
to judge me so harshly.

30:41.790 --> 30:42.920
You may deny it,

30:43.680 --> 30:44.640
but you should know

30:45.270 --> 30:46.880
everything you've done,

30:47.510 --> 30:49.270
once brought before His Majesty,

30:50.110 --> 30:51.750
will only lead to your own death.

30:55.200 --> 30:57.110
I know what Your Highness is capable of.

30:58.440 --> 30:59.640
But you'd better hurry,

31:01.110 --> 31:02.200
because

31:09.200 --> 31:12.000
I'll soon be the mother
of the dynasty's eldest grandson.

31:32.580 --> 31:36.340
(East Palace)

31:49.110 --> 31:50.830
Greetings, Crown Princess.

31:52.680 --> 31:53.830
No need for formalities.

31:54.176 --> 31:55.664
Please, have a seat.

31:58.350 --> 31:59.880
I've come unannounced today

32:00.070 --> 32:01.510
because there's a marriage

32:02.960 --> 32:04.880
I'd like to ask
Your Highness to arrange.

32:06.590 --> 32:08.880
I've loved the Crown Prince
for many years,

32:09.440 --> 32:10.550
but I also know

32:10.920 --> 32:12.110
the Crown Prince

32:12.350 --> 32:13.510
doesn't love me.

32:14.200 --> 32:15.160
I've come today

32:15.310 --> 32:17.400
not to pursue the Crown Prince,

32:17.720 --> 32:19.550
but to ask Your Highness
to arrange a match.

32:20.550 --> 32:22.200
I'm willing to marry Young Master Bu.

32:24.830 --> 32:26.110
I've long known

32:26.590 --> 32:27.590
Young Master Bu

32:28.160 --> 32:29.310
is a lady.

32:32.440 --> 32:33.720
When I was ten,

32:33.960 --> 32:35.480
I got lost at the Lantern Festival

32:35.920 --> 32:37.350
and was saved by Young Master Bu.

32:37.920 --> 32:39.880
We were in a private room then.

32:40.016 --> 32:41.880
Young Master Bu
thought I was unconscious,

32:41.880 --> 32:43.030
so she let down her guard.

32:43.232 --> 32:44.510
She took off her outer robe

32:45.070 --> 32:46.200
and let down her hair.

32:47.030 --> 32:48.400
Young Master Bu saved my life,

32:48.750 --> 32:50.920
so I've kept this secret

32:51.440 --> 32:53.550
and never told anyone.

32:56.350 --> 32:58.350
Since you already know
Young Master Bu's identity,

32:59.344 --> 33:00.880
why do you still wish to marry her?

33:01.200 --> 33:03.830
Yesterday, Prince Ning
went to see my aunt

33:04.270 --> 33:06.510
and asked her to find Young Master Bu

33:07.160 --> 33:10.240
a young lady with no parents
and no one to rely on.

33:10.830 --> 33:12.160
Quite a clever plan.

33:13.000 --> 33:14.000
With no one to rely on,

33:14.720 --> 33:16.510
she'd be easier for them to control,

33:17.200 --> 33:18.270
with nowhere to turn.

33:18.750 --> 33:19.590
I know

33:20.070 --> 33:22.110
Your Highness is close
to Young Master Bu

33:22.640 --> 33:24.200
and will surely protect her.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.000
Why not let me

33:26.790 --> 33:28.350
protect this secret?

33:29.310 --> 33:30.350
In this world,

33:30.790 --> 33:32.640
there's no one more suitable than I am.

33:34.000 --> 33:35.680
If you marry into Young Master's Manor,

33:36.550 --> 33:37.550
from this day on,

33:37.960 --> 33:39.720
wealth and honor will be yours.

33:39.888 --> 33:41.790
Young Master Bu
and the Marquis of Shunan

33:41.790 --> 33:43.552
will both be forever grateful to you.

33:44.030 --> 33:46.590
Your younger brother will also receive
the finest education.

33:47.200 --> 33:48.350
When he comes of age,

33:48.590 --> 33:51.160
Young Master Bu will pave
a bright future for him as well.

33:51.550 --> 33:53.110
But the price you'll have to pay

33:53.480 --> 33:56.030
is never being able to spend your life
with your true husband,

33:56.030 --> 33:58.400
sharing a lifelong, loving marriage.

33:59.110 --> 34:00.590
I want to protect Young Master Bu,

34:01.070 --> 34:03.160
but I don't want
to ruin someone else's life.

34:03.904 --> 34:06.200
Your wish to repay your debt
of gratitude is admirable,

34:06.790 --> 34:08.920
but you must think it through carefully.

34:09.510 --> 34:10.670
Don't act on impulse.

34:21.480 --> 34:22.840
After our conversation today,

34:23.550 --> 34:25.440
I truly admire Your Highness.

34:25.670 --> 34:26.960
I finally understand

34:27.360 --> 34:30.150
why the Crown Prince is devoted to you,

34:31.150 --> 34:33.280
and why the two of you
can stand side by side.

34:38.460 --> 34:41.700
(Clarity and Serenity)

34:53.550 --> 34:54.230
Your Highness,

34:55.110 --> 34:56.800
has your poison flared up again?

34:58.230 --> 34:59.840
Yunhuai has spared no effort.

35:02.070 --> 35:02.920
Don't worry.

35:09.590 --> 35:10.920
Tian Yuan told me

35:11.400 --> 35:12.590
the treatment

35:13.190 --> 35:14.110
is very painful.

35:16.280 --> 35:17.070
It's nothing.

35:18.550 --> 35:19.880
To me,

35:20.550 --> 35:21.550
it's nothing at all.

35:24.440 --> 35:26.000
Being able to see you for one more day

35:27.400 --> 35:28.480
is already a blessing.

37:19.136 --> 37:21.320
Ever since you added
the delicate qionghua blossoms,

37:21.630 --> 37:23.630
this medicine
has become much easier to take.

37:32.640 --> 37:35.040
The braided cord you asked for
on Chinese New Year's Eve.

37:41.800 --> 37:44.320
I wove mugwort and calamus into it.

37:44.670 --> 37:45.670
They say

37:45.712 --> 37:47.392
wearing a mugwort and calamus charm

37:47.710 --> 37:50.400
can ward off evil, avert misfortune,
and bring longevity.

37:54.440 --> 37:55.630
So this braided cord

37:56.880 --> 37:58.550
was specially made for me by you?

37:59.800 --> 38:01.070
It was specially made for you.

38:06.280 --> 38:08.880
May everything go smoothly for you.

38:09.120 --> 38:11.136
May illness and misfortune
be driven away.

38:11.728 --> 38:13.552
May you enjoy a long and healthy life.

38:47.670 --> 38:49.230
Is Your Highness feeling unwell again?

38:49.440 --> 38:51.590
Don't you think today's
fragrance is rather special?

38:52.070 --> 38:53.550
It has a cool and refreshing scent.

38:54.030 --> 38:55.030
Indeed.

38:58.920 --> 39:00.800
It's called Moonlit Cool Fragrance.

39:01.440 --> 39:03.550
Xihe blended it herself.

39:04.352 --> 39:06.710
Qionghua is also known
as the Beauty Beneath the Moon.

39:06.800 --> 39:08.768
That's why she named it
Moonlit Cool Fragrance.

39:09.000 --> 39:10.030
Xihe also said

39:10.030 --> 39:11.510
this fragrance is for me alone.

39:12.550 --> 39:13.510
She wants

39:13.920 --> 39:16.030
me to be surrounded by her scent.

39:19.920 --> 39:21.030
Your Highness,

39:21.030 --> 39:22.760
there's nothing
you won't say these days.

39:25.320 --> 39:26.288
I'll take my leave.

40:01.550 --> 40:02.760
Why does it smell so bloody?

40:04.800 --> 40:05.760
It's a pregnancy pulse.

40:05.840 --> 40:06.760
Since when?

40:06.880 --> 40:08.030
I've decided to marry.

40:08.030 --> 40:10.480
I'll find a lady who won't expose
my identity and marry her.

40:11.000 --> 40:11.880
This cup of tea

40:12.280 --> 40:13.710
is to sever all ties between us.

40:14.190 --> 40:16.110
Dispatch our most elite men

40:16.150 --> 40:17.510
at once to capture Bu Shulin.

40:17.510 --> 40:19.510
♪How can you be so wonderful?♪

40:23.950 --> 40:26.890
♪I've hidden so many words♪

40:27.510 --> 40:30.310
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

40:31.180 --> 40:38.150
♪So never uncover♪

40:38.340 --> 40:40.700
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

40:41.830 --> 40:44.560
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

40:45.520 --> 40:50.860
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

40:52.620 --> 40:55.440
♪Every answer I gave♪

40:56.240 --> 40:59.090
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

40:59.880 --> 41:03.250
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

41:03.510 --> 41:06.820
♪How hard it truly was?♪

41:09.790 --> 41:13.230
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

41:14.220 --> 41:16.550
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

41:17.820 --> 41:23.580
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

41:24.990 --> 41:28.120
♪It's a shame I never could♪

41:28.570 --> 41:31.580
♪Give you a moon in return♪

41:31.690 --> 41:38.330
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

41:38.330 --> 41:42.000
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

41:42.870 --> 41:45.630
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

41:46.070 --> 41:49.200
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

41:49.640 --> 41:55.590
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

41:56.990 --> 42:00.540
♪You'll never♪

42:00.820 --> 42:10.290
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

42:36.460 --> 42:39.940
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
